{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123391","id":4500812141,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDETxbQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123391","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123391.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123391.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123391","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123391/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123391/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123391/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b3574a906dd59b04070d04b400ddc0efbed4c439","number":123391,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix RenderingDevice thread ownership during shutdown","user":{"login":"Akrelion45","id":22620496,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjIwNDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22620496?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45","html_url":"https://github.com/Akrelion45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akrelion45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nFixes #119000.\n\nWith the separate rendering thread enabled, closing a project reports:\n\n```text\nERROR: This function (finalize) can only be called from the render thread.\n```\n\n## Additional information\n\n`_assign_mt_ids()` makes the main `RenderingDevice` current on the render worker. During shutdown, `finish()` waits for that worker to exit and resets `server_thread`, but the device still records the worker's thread ID. The display server then deletes the device on the main thread, where `finalize()` fails its thread guard.\n\nReturn the device to the calling thread after the worker has stopped, before the display server destroys it. The null check handles rendering backends without a `RenderingDevice`.\n\nTested with an empty `Node3D` project, separate rendering thread, and Forward+ on Windows 11 / RTX 2080 SUPER:\n\n- Official 4.8-dev5 (`9552dfb68`): the error and a warning about two leaked ObjectDB instances occur with both Vulkan and D3D12.\n- Local build from the same revision with the fix: both backends exit without those messages. The build also includes a texture-import change; the reproduction project contains no imported assets.\n\nThis PR targets `master`. The affected shutdown code is unchanged from the tested revision.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/lab